-to-send-a-parcel-to-slovenia" class="section-wrapper article-link-module article-link-module--neutral" data-slice-type="article_link_module" data-slice-variation="3Column" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!--[--><h2><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->How to send a parcel to Slovenia<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h2><!--]--><div class="article-link-module__section-description" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We offer three easy ways to send your parcels to Slovenia: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="article-link-module__cards-container" data-v-10a41d36><!--[--><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJBJbqstJ9-Tfe_EVRI_LOCATION_03_260152b8.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJBJbqstJ9-Tfe_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2601.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJBJbqstJ9-Tfe_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2601.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6TJBJbqstJ9-Tfe_EVRI_LOCATION_03_2601.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=47%2C0%2C5906%2C3939&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="ParcelShop store assistant is smiling and holding a blue hand-held device to scan a ParcelShop receipt to confirm the parcels have been dropped off." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ParcelShops<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your delivery online and drop off your parcel at 9,000+ ParcelShops near you. No printer? You can use our Print in-store devices to print your label for free. Plus, if you prefer to book with us in person, come and find us in selected Post Offices.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-ParcelShops-open ParcelShops page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->ParcelShops<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage25ebb.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4997%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4997%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/29b7db01-898f-4593-93e3-93d72ee215b0_lockerimage2.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;rect=1%2C0%2C4997%2C3333&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="Woman opening blue locker to place cardboard box inside" width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Lockers<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Book your parcel to Slovenia online and drop off at one of our secure Lockers. Open 24/7 in locations across the UK, simply scan your barcode when you arrive, place your parcel inside an available Locker and we’ll handle the rest. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Lockers-open Lockers page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/parcelshops/lockers" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Lockers<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_44528a65.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6pDqpbqstJ9-cfi_EVRI_LOCATION_04_4452.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="An Evri Courier scanning multiple parcels for a doorstep collection in a block of flats." width="1000" height="667" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><!----><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Courier collection<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Prefer a doorstep service? Book a courier collection online, choose a day that works for you, and one of our local couriers will pop by. We can collect your parcel from your home or office, and we’ll give you a 1-hour collection window so you know when to expect us.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="button-Courier collection-open Courier collection page" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="/courier-service" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Courier collection<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="how-long-does-it-take-to-send-a-parcel-to-slovenia?" class="section-wrapper" index="5" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aV03k3NYClf9o02Q_Sloveniaa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aV03k3NYClf9o02Q_Slovenia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aV03k3NYClf9o02Q_Slovenia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aV03k3NYClf9o02Q_Slovenia.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A landscape view of an island in a vivid blue lake with a church and red-roofed buildings in Slovenia." width="1000" height="666" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>How long does it take to send a parcel to Slovenia?</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The estimated delivery time for parcels sent to Slovenia is <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->9-12 working days<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> using our standard service.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20a